<rml>
<head>
<title>EN75 wyświetlacze</title>
<!--
Example (TSRE displays): an EMU's destination displays.

Shapes: KS_EN75_A.sd and KS_EN75_B.sd. The texture EN75_wyswietlacz.ace is
replaced by this document, the whole texture (1024 x 1024), Surface Glass,
Input Train.

The texture holds three front bands and three side bands, as the shape maps
them (its pantograph controls' parts show one band of each at a time), so
each band is drawn the same.

The front bands: the train's line (or its category and number) and its
destination: its own (#tsre.destination), else its last stop's station.

The side bands, centred (the window's frame hides the bands' edges): the
same, and under it the operator and, by the train's state, the station it
stands at, the one it approaches, or the stops still ahead of it before its
last (train.stops), a dot between them.

Data binding only.
-->
<style>
body, div {
    display: block;
}
span {
    display: inline;
}
body {
    margin: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: #000000;
    color: #ff8c1a;
    font-family: Noto Sans;
}
.band {
    position: absolute;
    left: 2%;
    width: 96%;
    overflow: hidden;
    white-space: nowrap;
}
.line {
    margin-right: 32px;
    color: #ffb347;
}

/* The front bands: one line, as tall as the band. */
.front {
    font-size: 86px;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-align: center;
}
#front1 {
    top: 13px;
    height: 123px;
    line-height: 123px;
}
#front2 {
    top: 181px;
    height: 126px;
    line-height: 126px;
}
#front3 {
    top: 333px;
    height: 123px;
    line-height: 123px;
}

/* The side bands: two lines. */
.side {
    left: 8%;
    width: 84%;
    text-align: center;
}
.side .big {
    margin-top: 30px;
    font-size: 60px;
    font-weight: bold;
}
.side .small {
    font-size: 40px;
}
.via {
    margin-left: 12px;
}
#side1 {
    top: 480px;
    height: 171px;
}
#side2 {
    top: 666px;
    height: 167px;
}
#side3 {
    top: 841px;
    height: 174px;
}
</style>
</head>
<body data-model="display">

<!-- The same text in each front band. -->
<div class="band front" id="front1">
    <span class="line" data-if="train.line != '' || train.category != '' || train.number != ''">{{train.line != '' ? train.line : train.category + ' ' + train.number}}</span>{{train.destination}}
</div>
<div class="band front" id="front2">
    <span class="line" data-if="train.line != '' || train.category != '' || train.number != ''">{{train.line != '' ? train.line : train.category + ' ' + train.number}}</span>{{train.destination}}
</div>
<div class="band front" id="front3">
    <span class="line" data-if="train.line != '' || train.category != '' || train.number != ''">{{train.line != '' ? train.line : train.category + ' ' + train.number}}</span>{{train.destination}}
</div>

<!-- The same text in each side band. -->
<div class="band side" id="side1">
    <div class="big">
        <span class="line" data-if="train.line != '' || train.category != '' || train.number != ''">{{train.line != '' ? train.line : train.category + ' ' + train.number}}</span>{{train.destination}}
    </div>
    <div class="small" data-if="train.state == 'standing'">{{train.operator}} · Stacja: {{train.at}}</div>
    <div class="small" data-if="train.state == 'approaching'">{{train.operator}} · Dojeżdżamy do: {{train.next}}</div>
    <div class="small" data-if="train.state != 'standing' &amp;&amp; train.state != 'approaching'">
        {{train.operator}} · przez:
        <span data-for="stop, i : train.stops">
            <span class="via" data-if="!stop.passed &amp;&amp; i + 1 &lt; train.stops.size">{{stop.station}}<span data-if="i + 2 &lt; train.stops.size"> ·</span></span>
        </span>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="band side" id="side2">
    <div class="big">
        <span class="line" data-if="train.line != '' || train.category != '' || train.number != ''">{{train.line != '' ? train.line : train.category + ' ' + train.number}}</span>{{train.destination}}
    </div>
    <div class="small" data-if="train.state == 'standing'">{{train.operator}} · Stacja: {{train.at}}</div>
    <div class="small" data-if="train.state == 'approaching'">{{train.operator}} · Dojeżdżamy do: {{train.next}}</div>
    <div class="small" data-if="train.state != 'standing' &amp;&amp; train.state != 'approaching'">
        {{train.operator}} · przez:
        <span data-for="stop, i : train.stops">
            <span class="via" data-if="!stop.passed &amp;&amp; i + 1 &lt; train.stops.size">{{stop.station}}<span data-if="i + 2 &lt; train.stops.size"> ·</span></span>
        </span>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="band side" id="side3">
    <div class="big">
        <span class="line" data-if="train.line != '' || train.category != '' || train.number != ''">{{train.line != '' ? train.line : train.category + ' ' + train.number}}</span>{{train.destination}}
    </div>
    <div class="small" data-if="train.state == 'standing'">{{train.operator}} · Stacja: {{train.at}}</div>
    <div class="small" data-if="train.state == 'approaching'">{{train.operator}} · Dojeżdżamy do: {{train.next}}</div>
    <div class="small" data-if="train.state != 'standing' &amp;&amp; train.state != 'approaching'">
        {{train.operator}} · przez:
        <span data-for="stop, i : train.stops">
            <span class="via" data-if="!stop.passed &amp;&amp; i + 1 &lt; train.stops.size">{{stop.station}}<span data-if="i + 2 &lt; train.stops.size"> ·</span></span>
        </span>
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</rml>
